[
    {
        "content": "<p>I'm getting this error:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code>── ✗ type mismatch ────────────────────────────────────────── src/main.roc:9:5\n\nThis ? may return early with a type that doesn't match the function body.\n\nStdout.line!(\"Hello,World!\")?\n^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n\nIf this Try is an Err, then the ? after it immediately returns an Err whose\npayload has this type:\n\n    [StdoutErr(Str)]\n\nReturning an Err with that type only works if the function itself returns a Try\nwith a compatible error type, but this function's return type is:\n\n    Try({}, [Exit(I32), StdoutErr(Str)])\n\nHint: The error types from all ? operators and the function body must be\ncompatible, since any of them could be the actual return value.\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>and I cant figure out what it means. The types look compatible. Is it a bug?<br>\nI also cant figure out how to replicate it in a minimal setup</p>",
        "id": 629515108,
        "sender_full_name": "johan alley",
        "timestamp": 1791286890
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Which platform are you using?</p>",
        "id": 629526610,
        "sender_full_name": "Luke Boswell",
        "timestamp": 1791289575
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>What is the type annotation for the platforms <code>Stdout.line!</code>?</p>",
        "id": 629526758,
        "sender_full_name": "Luke Boswell",
        "timestamp": 1791289606
    },
    {
        "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>Which platform are you using?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>My own<br>\nWas trying to make a raylib one but I was getting errors, so I started over and was trying to just remake the zig template platform first to have a reference while learning how to make a platform.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>What is the type annotation for the platforms <code>Stdout.line!</code>?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>Host.roc:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"CoffeeScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nx\">Host</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[].{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">stderr_line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Try</span><span class=\"p\">({},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">StderrErr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">stdin_line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Try</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">StdinErr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">stdout_line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Try</span><span class=\"p\">({},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">StdoutErr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Stdout.roc:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"CoffeeScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nx\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Host</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">Stdout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[].{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">=&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Try</span><span class=\"p\">({},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">StdoutErr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Host</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">stdout_line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>main.roc:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"CoffeeScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"nx\">app</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">main</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">roc</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"nightly-2026-10-04-130536d\"</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">pf</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">platform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"platform/main.roc\"</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">pf</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">Stdout</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">main</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">List</span><span class=\"nf\">(Str) =&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Try</span><span class=\"p\">({},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">Exit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">I32</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">StdoutErr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">main</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"nx\">_args</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">Stdout</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">line</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s\">\"Hello,World!\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">?</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">Ok</span><span class=\"p\">({})</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
