        "timestamp": 1791290475
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Does it work if you use <code>main! : List(Str) =&gt; Try({}, _)</code> i.e. add a <code>_</code> type hole instead?</p>",
        "id": 629531004,
        "sender_full_name": "Luke Boswell",
        "timestamp": 1791290548
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>yup, this is a known issue! currently polarity does not apply to host functions return types (ie returned tag unions are not implicitly opened), because the host ABI contract requires a closed union exactly</p>\n<p>to fix, i believe we will need to implement an implicit remapping when you use a host function like this, along the lines of an implicit match to instantiate it as open</p>",
        "id": 629532240,
        "sender_full_name": "Jared Ramirez",
        "timestamp": 1791290833
    },
    {
        "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>Does it work if you use <code>main! : List(Str) =&gt; Try({}, _)</code> i.e. add a <code>_</code> type hole instead?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"CoffeeScript\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"err\">──</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">✗</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">mismatch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">────────────────────────────────────────────</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">src</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"nx\">main</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">roc</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">9</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">platform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">requires</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">main</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"nx\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">have</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">specific</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">type</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">main</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"nx\">_args</span><span class=\"o\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">^^^^^^^</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">Here</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">it</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">has</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">type</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">List</span><span class=\"nf\">(Str) =&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Try</span><span class=\"p\">({},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">StdoutErr</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">Str</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">But</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">platform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">requires</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"nx\">List</span><span class=\"nf\">(Str) =&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Try</span><span class=\"p\">({},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">Exit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">I32</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n<span class=\"nx\">The</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">requirement</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">is</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">declared</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">here</span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">requires</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">main</span><span class=\"o\">!</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">List</span><span class=\"nf\">(Str) =&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">Try</span><span class=\"p\">({},</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">Exit</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">I32</span><span class=\"p\">),</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">..])</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">              </span><span class=\"o\">^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
