    {
        "content": "<blockquote>\n<p>I'm not sure if we should remap automatically</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"user-mention\" data-user-id=\"281383\">@Richard Feldman</span>  why though? I expect most of the platform functions I make wont need a wrapper (other than to avoid this issue)</p>",
        "id": 629552409,
        "sender_full_name": "johan alley",
        "timestamp": 1791294831
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>short answer is that we've found a number of scenarios where re-mapping is something we could do...but there consistently end up being pitfalls during implementation, and it's still not clear to me that it's a good idea to hide such a significant cost as a (potentially large) <code>match</code></p>",
        "id": 629570865,
        "sender_full_name": "Richard Feldman",
        "timestamp": 1791298325
    }
